Commit df7d7a2c, parked on phase/8.4 (tag deleted 2026-10-16)
Subject: feat(web-ui): add the Plain language / Researcher toggle to the answer status strip

Card 33, product-owner decision 2026-09-25. DepthControl before asking is
unchanged; a new DepthStripToggle transcribes the same two-button pill,
with no repeated label or info affordance, into the answer's own status
strip beside Show work, exactly where Main.dc.html and Researcher.dc.html
draw it. AnswerScreen wires it only into the live, landed turn, never the
streaming preview or a folded previous turn, so it structurally cannot
render while a run is in flight (item 9.12's lock). App.tsx's onDepthChange
re-runs the same question at the other depth through the same ask() a
follow-up uses, continuing the thread, so the prior answer folds in rather
than vanishing and the switch counts as one question against the daily cap.


